{"pageid":2885,"title":"Stars","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Stars</span>","revid":18571,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #1482f7; background:#0c3b6e; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n \n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004548\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Incorrect\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1d/Hexagon_Incorrect.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004548\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Incorrect.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Incorrect.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-top:0.7em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page may contain <i>missing</i> or <i>inaccurate</i> information!</span><br />\n</p><p><span>Certain information in this page is missing or may contain inaccurate information. If you can cite where this particular information comes from, please add a citation - especially with percent calculations! The list following this notice denotes important potential inaccuracies and omissions.\n</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<pre><code>- Star Chances need further testing for confirmation.</code>\n</pre>\n<pre>- Spawn chances for stars during weather conditions (e.g. stormy) need verification.\n</pre>\n<p><br />\n<i><big>\"A wonderous delight sent by the gods of above. Providing essence and love to all. They're also worth money, try selling them!\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041421\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Main Titles\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/b2/Diamond_Main_Titles.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/75?cb=20250605041421\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Main Titles.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Main_Titles.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> Stars</span></h2>\n<p><b>Stars</b> are a resource and material in Oaklands. They spawn at night, and come in 5 different colors, similarly to <a href=\"/wiki/Fireflies\" title=\"Fireflies\">fireflies</a>. Stars can also be used as a building material, taking the form of a colored forcefield material when placed into a schematic. Stars fall from the sky at night. Every night has a 1 in 5 chance of being a star rain, which greatly increases the amount of stars that fall. They can be sold at the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>.\n</p><p>Stars come in 5 colors, each of a different value and rarity.\n</p>\n<table style=\"margin:auto;\" class=\"sortable article-table\">\n<caption>Star Chances\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Yellow, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a ~84% or ~8/10 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Green, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a 10% or 1/10 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Red, <span style=\"color:#daba97;\">common rarity</span>, has a 5% or 1/20 spawn chance.\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blue, <span style=\"color:#acbacb;\">uncommon rarity</span>, has a 0.9% or roughly ~1/100 spawn chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Purple, <span style=\"color:#ffd454;\">rare rarity</span>, is the rarest variant. Has a &lt;0.1% or 1/1000 spawn chance.\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\nNote that the frequency of star spawns depend upon the <i>weather</i>: \n</p>\n<ul><li>During <u>stormy</u> conditions (such as rainy or thunderstorm), star spawning is reduced by about 0.5X.</li>\n<li>A clear night has a 1/5 chance to be a <u>meteor shower/star rain</u>, where stars spawn 2X more than usual.</li>\n<li>Any stars that are not claimed will disappear at 6:30.</li></ul>\n<table style=\"margin:auto;\" class=\"sortable article-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Image\n</th>\n<th>Color Variant\n</th>\n<th>Sell Value\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e5/Yellow_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20240528032726\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Yellow Star\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e5/Yellow_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20240528032726\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Yellow Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Yellow_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Yellow Star\n</td>\n<td>$250\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/05/Green_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20240528032824\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Green Star\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Green Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Green_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/05/Green_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20240528032824\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Green Star\n</td>\n<td>$350\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Red_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20240528032857\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Red Star\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Red Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Red_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/ab/Red_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20240528032857\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Red Star\n</td>\n<td>$750\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Blue_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20240528140829\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Blue Star\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"79\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blue Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Blue_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e0/Blue_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20240528140829\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Blue Star\n</td>\n<td>$1200\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1f/Purple_Star.png/revision/latest?cb=20240528195745\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Purple Star\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Purple Star.png\" data-image-key=\"Purple_Star.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/1/1f/Purple_Star.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/80?cb=20240528195745\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Purple Star\n</td>\n<td>$4800\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest?cb=20250616224254\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Question\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Question.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Question.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/dd/Hexagon_Question.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250616224254\" /></a></span> Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Stars resemble Star Bits from Super Mario Galaxy. The original suggestion on Discord was actually based upon Star Bits.</li>\n<li>When viewing the description of a star, it shimmers with all the colors of the rainbow.</li>\n<li>Blue and Purple Stars have high trading value - it is not recommended to sell them; make a trade with them instead!</li>\n<li>You can save rare stars when filling out schematics by using Yellow Stars. For example, fill a schematic up to 90-95% with Yellow Stars; then, put a Purple Star in to complete the schematic. If done correctly, the schematic will form a material from the rarer variant - useful if you want to do a big project needing a lot of rare stars.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902181909\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 23/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 629/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    1.615      1 Template:Missing_Info\n100.00%    1.615      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2885-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 2026090